'''''Sleepless Night''''' is a [[Trailblaze Mission]] in the chapter [[The Sound and the Fury]].

==Steps==
# Go to the Dreamscape Sales Store
# Explore as you please
# Investigate the source of the disturbance
# Defeat the enemy

